OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies after being hit by
OL,4,ARange Rover on A70 in Ayrshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 66-year-old woman has died in
OL,7,Fhospital after being hit by a car on
OL,8,Fthe A70 Muirkirk Road near Cumnock.
OL,10,FThe incident took place about 08:05 on
OL,11,FFriday and involved a pedestrian and a
OL,12,Fwhite Range Rover Evoque.
OL,14,FJaqueline Young, from Cumnock, was
OL,15,Ftaken to hospital for treatment but has
OL,16,Fsince passed away.
OL,18,FPolice Scotland said inquiries into the
OL,19,Fincident were ongoing and it was keen
OL,20,Fto speak to any motorists who witnessed
OL,21,Fit.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
